    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9059" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">col-lēvo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">con-</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-laevo</span></b> ), āre, v. a.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to</i>
			
			<i>make entirely smooth</i>, <i>to
			smooth</i> (post-class. and rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">plagam arboris falce,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 22, 35, § 192</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">asperitatem oculorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 64, 7</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">interanea vesicae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					23, 1, 18, § 30</span></i>
			.</div>
